{"id":"ouverture","lemma":"ouverture","pos":"noun","rank":2008,"glosses":["opening","overture"],"ipa":"/u.vɛʁ.tyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/ff/Fr-ouverture.ogg/Fr-ouverture.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ouvertures"},"formAudio":{"ouvertures":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-ouvertures.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La cérémonie d'ouverture a eu lieu hier.","en":"The opening ceremony took place yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"ceremony"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Ils attendaient l'ouverture de la porte.","en":"They were waiting for the gate to open.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"door"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Je ne serai pas à la cérémonie d'ouverture.","en":"I won't be at the opening ceremony.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"ceremony"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Tu devrais faire preuve de plus d'ouverture d'esprit.","en":"You should be more open-minded.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"mind, spirit"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"to show"],[4,6,"moreover, furthermore"]]},{"text":"Nous sommes invités à la cérémonie d'ouverture.","en":"We've been invited to the opening ceremony.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"invited","l":"invité"},null,null,{"g":"ceremony"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]}]}